plete-zsh)\r\n\r\nBefore this commit, you would get an error after step 1.\r\nAfter this commit, it should work as expected.\r\n\r\nWe also improve the FAQ item for zsh completions.\r\n\r\nFixes #2956","tree":{"sha":"e3f23964cb57d566b7638b4015717f8a4e7a8cd1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BurntSushi/ripgrep/git/trees/e3f23964cb57d566b7638b4015717f8a4e7a8cd1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BurntSushi/ripgrep/git/commits/94305125ef33b86151b6cd2ce2b33d641f6b6ac3","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJnc/BBCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAdLAQAB4TSGWGACj3NA3wFqHHlrK3\nefWFACvoLaypXqbss56z7FLd6OoCyLba5S7UJf0w7YSfkmiwFC/48kQM2zMz6Wb5\n0Wev/AjuoqoOevRLrJpi488XqRDKHeOG/jxb67ln0HUigwe1Y88uxBGabImhMdt6\ndepv0j7nRclshWnl4pfTTvqQNJP394tNL/vpZ01OmWMaQcXtgU5sDkGPlRNSVguN\n4DVk/zLsHZj4f3GMCuQca/VqQ9qqCZfp0vOmR26NulZeRqwgm70lQdd001ERV/AZ\nqz7N5gwMx7Y3skfQd6LQ0fhc3Z+PUHhTbejBsH4067xUdcSMmH8Gxa7XWtO3qL7l\nYX1YCOg1vCiqmPKz72u4ePsAUq2UpzqA3RaMwlHCdCuSXBZZG1vT1xZwA3KqWHKC\nceJqQdyVCTjBW/RjyXCuEj1aGY/STBJqEDPFBMLAUEvM2CgIJMgemrJhzTWzK+I/\nP75+1A2JHWri8xcdn69PyB0KYZ0GnFRxA8W+oIU+wH0F639d9pFAdIunickBfrKz\nYM/5mJV1/KmDb6KzEU8IDqFufkjMEgY9ymOwngl3sCupfFbdsPJXMEafCiSFmtym\neFKT2Hxe8mDAScPs4prbwkBiNHBrNBulsQeV5ugTgJICaRm2jiAFwvHdU2KqCIqJ\n+hxzYZjW1x/TuHXPkFK6\n=x7Vw\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree e3f23964cb57d566b7638b4015717f8a4e7a8cd1\nparent 79cbe89deb1151e703f4d91b19af9cdcc128b765\nauthor Max Coplan <mchcopl@gmail.com> 1735651393 -0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1735651393 -0500\n\nzsh: support sourcing zsh completion dynamically\n\nPreviously, you needed to save the completion script to a file and\r\nthen source it. Now, you can dynamically source completions in zsh by\r\nrunning\r\n\r\n    $ source <(rg --generate complete-zsh)\r\n\r\nBefore this commit, you would get an error after step 1.\r\nAfter this commit, it should work as expected.\r\n\r\nWe also improve the FAQ item f